@startuml
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
title Language server system architecture

top to bottom direction

component "Monaco editor\nCodeEditor" as Editor
component "Monarch tokenizer\nand language providers" as Providers
component "AssemblerLanguageClient" as Client
component "WebSocket /language" as WS
component "Server WebSocket handler" as Handler
component "AssemblerLanguageSession\none per connection" as Session
component "Open documents\nURI, text, version,\nsaved flag, cached analysis" as Documents
component "Assembler library\nassembleDetailed()" as Assembler
component "AssemblyResult\nCodeMemory + AssemblyInfo" as Result

Editor --> Providers
Providers --> Client
Client --> WS
WS --> Handler
Handler --> Session
Session --> Documents
Session --> Assembler
Assembler --> Result
Result --> Session
Session --> Handler
Handler --> WS
WS --> Client
Client --> Editor

note right of Client
  Sends JSON-RPC requests and
  document lifecycle notifications.
  Reconnect reopens known documents.
end note

note right of Session
  Handles initialization, full-text
  open/change/save/close, diagnostics,
  completion, hover, definition,
  references and rename.
end note

note right of Assembler
  Whole-document analysis is reused
  until document text changes.
  It does not load or run a project.
end note

note bottom of WS
  One JSON-RPC message per WebSocket
  text frame. This is an LSP-shaped
  subset over WebSocket transport.
end note
@enduml
